# Normalise line endings so a Windows checkout doesn't commit CRLF that then
# confuses Linux/macOS contributors (and vice versa). Text files are stored
# with LF in the repo; Git converts on checkout per each machine's settings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
